      "field": "capital / commercial（官方首页横幅与业务自述）",
      "claim": "官网首页横幅与正文自述：Nimble 完成 1.06 亿美元融资、估值 10 亿美元，并与 FedEx 一起扩展完全自主履单（fully autonomous fulfillment）；公司定位为机器人第三方物流（robotic 3PL），称其 AI 技术已在服装、健康与美容、鞋类、电子、快消品等品类拣选、包装并处理数百万件商品，服务对象从「标志性财富 500 强企业」到高成长品牌；公司通过全国机器人履单中心网络为 DTC 品牌提供美国境内快速且低成本的配送",
      "quote": "Nimble Closes $106 Million at $1B Valuation, Scales Fully Autonomous Fulfillment with FedEx. Learn More. … Offer free 2-day or less delivery using Nimble — the robotic 3PL. … Our AI technology has picked, packed and handled millions of items across apparel, health & beauty, footwear, electronics, consumer packaged goods, and more for iconic fortune 500 companies to high-growth brands. … By leveraging our national network of robotic fulfillment centers, DTC brands can reach the US population fast and cost-effectively via economical ground transportation.",
